  <Copyright Notice="© Avolites Ltd. 2019" />
  <Thumbnail>1b8529af-f507-4d94-af64-9ccc35b57acf</Thumbnail>
  <History Date="20-06-15" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="25-05-16" Author="AtlaBaseLibraryUpdater" Comment="Added AltaBase information" />
  <History Date="09-07-16" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added compatibility for R20 export.  Added missing Atlabase ID's." />
  <History Date="26-03-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from TMB Solaris LED Flare (note no RDM personality ID's available.  RDM will fail some of the modes)" />
  <History Date="26-03-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." />
  <History Date="11-04-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed shutter and duration to default at 255 in 52 channel mode in response to manufacturer request." />
  <History Date="11-04-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added multi-part patch options in attempt to solve Strobe Int and Master Dimmer LTP (note it is not currently possible to automatically patch in Capture using these)" />
  <History Date="11-04-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Changed 1 Pixel mode to use cells in attempt to solve LTP dimmer issues." />
  <History Date="12-04-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed wheel mapping conflict." />
